#: lib/mactrack_functions.php
msgid "Are you sure you want to delete all the Port to MAC to IP results from the system?"
msgstr "Uqinisekile ukuthi ufuna ukususa yonke imiphumela ye-Port to MAC to IP kusistimu?"

#: lib/mactrack_functions.php
msgid "Are you sure you want to delete the expired Port to MAC to IP results now?"
msgstr "Uqinisekile ukuthi ufuna ukususa imiphumela ye-Port to MAC to IP ephelelwe yisikhathi manje?"

#: lib/mactrack_functions.php
msgid "Are you sure you want to purge the cached Mactrack scanning functions?"
msgstr "Uqinisekile ukuthi ufuna ukuhlanza imisebenzi yokuskena ye-Mactrack egcinwe ku-cache?"

#: lib/mactrack_functions.php
msgid "Are you sure you want to delete all the Aggregated Port to MAC to IP results from the system?"
msgstr "Uqinisekile ukuthi ufuna ukususa yonke imiphumela Ehlanganisiwe ye-Port to MAC to IP kusistimu?"

#: lib/mactrack_functions.php
msgid "Are you sure you want to delete and recreate all the Aggregated Port to MAC to IP results from the system?"
msgstr "Uqinisekile ukuthi ufuna ukususa futhi wakhe kabusha yonke imiphumela Ehlanganisiwe ye-Port to MAC to IP kusistimu?"

#: lib/mactrack_functions.php
msgid "Are you sure you want to download and import the IEEE Vendor MAC/OUI database now?"
msgstr "Uqinisekile ukuthi ufuna ukulanda nokungenisa isizindalwazi se-IEEE Vendor MAC/OUI manje?"

#: lib/mactrack_functions.php
msgid "Are you sure you want to rebuild the scan date list from the stored Port to MAC to IP results now?"
msgstr "Uqinisekile ukuthi ufuna ukwakha kabusha uhlu lwedethi yokuskena kusuka emiphumeleni egciniwe ye-Port kuya ku-MAC kuya ku-IP manje?"

#: lib/mactrack_functions.php
msgid "Rebuild and analyze the partition containing the latest port observation, which is the current week with weekly partitions. An unpartitioned table is optimized in full. Scheduled scans are skipped while this runs. Continue?"
msgstr "Yakha kabusha futhi uhlaziye ingxenye equkethe ukubonwa kwembobo kwakamuva, okuyiviki lamanje ngezingxenyeni zamaviki onke. Ithebula elingahlukanisiwe lilungiselelwa ngokugcwele. Ukuskena okuhleliwe kuyeqiwa ngenkathi lokhu kusebenza. Qhubeka?"

#: lib/mactrack_functions.php
msgid "Run this maintenance off hours. The rebuild copies the full history of the port (MAC address), IP address and 802.1x tables one after the other and can take hours. Scheduled scans are skipped, database maintenance waits, and MAC, IP and 802.1x searching shows a maintenance message until it finishes. Allow free disk space for a second copy of each table and its indexes. Continue?"
msgstr "Qalisa lokhu kulungiswa ngaphandle kwamahora omsebenzi. Ukwakha kabusha kukopisha wonke umlando wamathebula echweba (ikheli le-MAC), ikheli le-IP kanye ne-802.1x ngokulandelana futhi kungathatha amahora. Ukuhlola okuhleliwe kuyeqiwa, ukulungiswa kwesizindalwazi kuyalinda, futhi ukusesha kwe-MAC, i-IP kanye ne-802.1x kubonisa umlayezo wokulungiswa kuze kuphele. Vumela isikhala sediski esikhululekile sekhophi yesibili yethebula ngalinye nezinkomba zalo. Qhubeka?"

