#: mactrack_utilities.php
msgid "Database Administration"
msgstr "Ukuphathwa Kwedathabheyisi"

#: mactrack_utilities.php
msgid "Deletes expired Port to MAC to IP associations from the database.  Only records that have expired, based upon your criteria are removed."
msgstr "Isusa ukuhlobana kwe-Port ne-MAC kuya ku-IP okuphelelwe yisikhathi kusizindalwazi. Amarekhodi aphelelwe yisikhathi kuphela, ngokusekelwe kumibandela yakho, asuswayo."

#: mactrack_utilities.php
msgid "Refresh IEEE Vendor MAC/OUI Database"
msgstr "Vuselela Isizindalwazi se-MAC/OUI Yomthengisi we-IEEE"

#: mactrack_utilities.php
msgid "This function will download and install the latest OIU database from the IEEE Website.  Each Network Interface Card (NIC) has a MAC Address.  The MAC Address can be broken into two parts.  The first part of the MAC Address contains the Vendor MAC.  The Vendor MAC identifies who manufactured the part.  This will be helpful in spot checking for rogue devices on your network."
msgstr "Lo msebenzi uzolanda futhi ufake isizindalwazi sakamuva se-OIU kusuka kuWebhusayithi ye-IEEE. Ikhadi ngalinye le-Network Interface Card (NIC) linekheli le-MAC. Ikheli le-MAC lingahlukaniswa libe yizingxenye ezimbili. Ingxenye yokuqala yekheli le-MAC iqukethe i-Vendor MAC. I-Vendor MAC ikhomba ukuthi ubani okhiqize leyo ngxenye. Lokhu kuzoba usizo ekuhloleni ngokushesha amadivayisi angagunyaziwe kunethiwekhi yakho."

#: mactrack_utilities.php
msgid "Deletes old and potentially stale Mactrack scanning functions from the drop-down you receive when you edit a device type."
msgstr "Isusa imisebenzi yokuskena ye-Mactrack emidala nengase ingasasebenzi ohlwini olwehlayo olutholayo uma uhlela uhlobo lwedivayisi."

#: mactrack_utilities.php
msgid "Deletes <strong>ALL</strong> Port to MAC to IP associations from the database all IP Addresses, IP Ranges, and VLANS.  This utility is good when you want to start over.  <strong>DANGER: All prior data is deleted.</strong>"
msgstr "Isusa <strong>KONKE</strong> ukuhlobana kwe-Port ne-MAC kuya ku-IP kusizindalwazi, wonke Amakheli e-IP, Amabanga e-IP, nama-VLAN. Leli thuluzi lihle uma ufuna ukuqala kabusha. <strong>INGOZI: Yonke idatha yangaphambilini iyasuswa.</strong>"

#: mactrack_utilities.php
msgid "Rebuilds the list of scan dates from the stored Port to MAC to IP results, reading each partition once. Scans and maintenance keep the list current, so this is only needed after results were removed outside of maintenance, for example by deleting devices."
msgstr "Yakha kabusha uhlu lwezinsuku zokuskena kusukela emiphumeleni egciniwe ye-Port kuya ku-MAC kuya ku-IP, ifunda ingxenye ngayinye kanye. Ukuskena nokunakekela kugcina uhlu lusesikhathini, ngakho lokhu kudingeka kuphela ngemva kokuba imiphumela isusiwe ngaphandle kokunakekela, isibonelo ngokususa amadivayisi."

#: mactrack_utilities.php
msgid "View Partition Status"
msgstr "Buka Isimo Sesahlukaniso"

#: mactrack_utilities.php
msgid "Shows how the Port to MAC to IP results are partitioned, the partition size in use and why, and what the last database maintenance did."
msgstr "Ibonisa ukuthi imiphumela ye-Port ukuya ku-MAC ukuya ku-IP ihlukaniswe kanjani, usayizi wokuhlukanisa osetshenziswayo nesizathu sawo, kanye nokuthi ukunakekelwa kwesizindalwazi kwakamuva kwenzani."

#: mactrack_utilities.php
msgid "Rebuilds and analyzes only the partition containing the latest port observation to reclaim deleted space; with weekly partitions that is the current week. Unpartitioned tables are optimized in full. Scheduled scans are skipped until it finishes."
msgstr "Yakha kabusha futhi ihlaziye kuphela ingxenye equkethe ukubonwa kwembobo kwakamuva ukuze kubuyiswe isikhala esisusiwe; ngezingxenyeni zamaviki onke lokho kuyiviki lamanje. Amathebula angahlukanisiwe alungiselelwa ngokugcwele. Ukuskena okuhleliwe kuyeqiwa kuze kube yilapho kuqedwa."

#: mactrack_utilities.php
msgid "Choose daily or weekly partitions, or disable partitioning, for the port (MAC address), IP address and 802.1x tables. The rebuild copies the full history in the background; scheduled scans are skipped and MAC, IP and 802.1x searching shows a maintenance message meanwhile."
msgstr "Khetha izahlukaniso zansuku zonke noma zamaviki onke, noma ukhubaze ukuhlukaniswa, kumathebula embobo (ikheli le-MAC), ikheli le-IP kanye ne-802.1x. Ukwakha kabusha kukopisha umlando ogcwele ngemuva; ukuskena okuhleliwe kuyeqiwa futhi ukusesha kwe-MAC, i-IP ne-802.1x kubonisa umlayezo wokunakekela okwamanje."

#: mactrack_utilities.php
msgid "Aggregated Table Administration"
msgstr "Ukuphathwa Kwethebula Elihlanganisiwe"

#: mactrack_utilities.php
msgid "Deletes ALL <strong>Aggregated</strong> (Not Scan Results) Port to MAC to IP associations from the database.  Data will again be collected on the basis of <strong>only new</strong> scanned data in the next mactrack poller run."
msgstr "Isusa KONKE ukuhlobana kwe-Port ne-MAC kuya ku-IP <strong>Okuhlanganisiwe</strong> (Hhayi Imiphumela Yokuskena) kusizindalwazi. Idatha izoqoqwa futhi ngokusekelwe kudatha eskeniwe <strong>entsha kuphela</strong> ekusebenzeni okulandelayo kwe-Poller ye-mactrack."

#: mactrack_utilities.php
