msgstr "Umsebenzi wokuskena we-Mactrack okufanele ubizwe ukuze kutholakale futhi kugcinwe imininingwane yembobo. Igama lomsebenzi kuphela elidingekayo. Amapharamitha amane alandelayo ayacatshangwa futhi ayohlala engezwa ekugcineni: 'my_function($site, &$device, $lowport, $highport)'. Akukho msebenzi odingekayo ku-router emsulwa."

